        "randomness": 50
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thought I told you to go hide, Kafka. Whaddaya over here for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Aw, gawd, I'm fine. Just tell me what's going on, and make it slick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "xstrength": 2,
        "ystrength": 2,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 50
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, just take a look. Infected and Non-Infected don't see eye to eye most times, hey? So we split into two sides and brawl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, yeah, that happens for sure, but the jailers don't care?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I want you to look at them careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
