        "name2": "avg_npc_134",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Clicks tongue* Sure do love a good inmate fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer A"
    },
    {
        "text": "We hit the jackpot with today's shift.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_134",
        "name2": "avg_npc_134",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahah, right you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer B"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the moment. The only joy working in this hellhole.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get their asses, A-Zoners! I'm watchin' you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
