        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You see that? They're living it up like no one else here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Plus, the side that wins gets slightly better eats for the next while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is all their fun? What's stopping us from just not fighting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "xstrength": 2,
        "ystrength": 2,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 50
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not fighting? Kafka, you know how I got slammed up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Took the scruff of everyone who looked down on me, and I socked 'em!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "xstrength": 2,
        "ystrength": 2,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 50
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_133"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Kafka. I reckon, all the places in the goddamn world, this is the only one where you can bust Non-Infected jaws and the fuzz can't even be assed to slap you on the wrist.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beat someone to death? You get locked in for a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, if you're really gonna die, you're gonna die. Who's scared of that in prison?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beh, I'm done. You get it. I'm gonna go back and make hay. You find somewhere and stay low!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
