    {
        "text": "Beh yourself. You're lookin' down on Kafka, you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "text": "But man. I guess the Infected and the Non-Infected still live the same old clash in here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not just living it, even. Idea's gone mutant. Supermutant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've seen a thing or two outside, but I've gotta admit, if this ain't a first for me... If Silence was watching this, she'd be sick to the bone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "text": "But sorry, Silence, 'cause I'm different. Heheh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Messier the sitch gets, the more I like it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "text": "You fight your thing, and I'll go see what pies I can't get my fingers in. That gets me ready for the next bit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
