    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_134",
        "name2": "avg_npc_134",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Superintendent Barton, sir! The prisoners are fighting!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_135#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're sitting there watching? You ain't stoppin' them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Barton"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_134",
        "name2": "avg_npc_134",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Superintendent. Time's up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_135#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't give a hoot which way the time is, it's our duty as jailers to manage the prisoners!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Barton"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_134"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you lot! Superintendent says it's time to quit it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jailer A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "stop": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_133",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Columbian slang*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoners"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_132",
        "name2": "avg_npc_132"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Columbian dialect*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "A-Zone Prisoners"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_135#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Urgh. I've said it before and I'll say it again. This is prison. Not your consarned battlefield.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Barton"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y'all should be workin' proper. Actin' proper. Only way your moms, pops 'n' buds out there'll see you a day sooner. You hear me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Barton"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm tellin' you this for your own good...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Barton"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch. Here we go again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow, there's a couple marks on you. Y'alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right as rain. Scratches! And I got to smash in a few A-Zone dirtbags for the trouble. Heheh, fine deal to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And it winds down like this every time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean Barton?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, more or less. He's the jailers' Super. Always shows up at times like these, puts on the vaudeville and hits the brakes. Then says some meaningful crap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Especially moments like now when the place's stopped over at a city, the warden's gone and he acts like he's lord of the prison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dropped on his head as a kid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it ain't every time this happens, I'll tell you that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Plenty of times it don't stop for nothin'... I'd say most of the time, actually. Not that often it's over when over says, like today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "But when it just won't end, you'll see Barton call in his safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "His what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yup. There he is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Anthony?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you really do know him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_133",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, I've only seen him all dressed up before...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_264_Mountain_1#5"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
